is a Hindu spiritual practice that has long existed in India. Decorative Nazar Battus is made of either cloth or metal and are shaped like eyes. They are hung outside of houses to keep away evil spirits. People think putting up a Nazar Battu will protect them and their property from bad energies. People believe that Nazar Battus protects people and their homes and brings luck and wealth into a person's life. Using Nazar Battus has been done for hundreds of years and is still done by many people today. What is Nazar Battu for Home? Some parts of India still use Nazar Battu for Home \u0026 Office, an old spiritual practice. The Hindu religion started the tradition of putting a Nazar Battu outside of one's home to keep away evil spirits. People have done this for hundreds of years because they think it keeps terrible energies away from them and their land. \"Najar\" is a word for an object in the shape of an eye made of cloth or metal, and \"Battu\" is a word for the string that connects this protected talisman to its owner. People think that Nazar Battus can bring luck and wealth to their lives and protect them and their homes. Buy Wall Hanging Nazar Battu Online at the Best Price The best place to buy Nazar Battu for Home online is Pujasthan. This online store sells high-quality Nazar Battus at prices that can't be beaten. Pujasthan has everything, whether you want something special or something more traditional. The Nazar Suraksha Yantra is often hung on the door or in the office to protect against the evil eye and keep away bad energy. It comes in many shapes and sizes, so you can find one that fits your style and tastes perfectly. The designs at Pujasthan are beautifully made and have a lot of small features that set them apart from other methods. Each product that Pujasthan sells is checked to make sure it is natural and will last. Tip: Devotees often buy Sabut Urad Dal for Nazar Utara.","Pujasthan",0,"Wall Hanging Nazar Battu for Home, Office, Nazar Suraksha Kawach for House, Evil Eye Protector",null,null,"","0",[null,null,"D7bwlucot/yuD3iXsUHxuR5sNN8GYOB448sz/ldZfFI\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,0,0,1,null,0,0,"15233628828738592209","/search?q\u003dnazar+battu+with+transparent+bg\u0026prds\u003dheadlineOfferDocid:2276446536113155851,catalogid:2589714322369596591,pvo:4\u0026ibp\u003doshop",null,null,null,null,null,["AF5tSO6VThosb1G8m3C64rvAozhmsfXVsg:1786037571171",""]]]}],null,null,null,null,null,"veR6P6_KniH3MM",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,0]],"QsV0aqixNMCYhvcP062aqQ8178":[0,"veR6P6_KniH3MM",["https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q\u003dtbn:ANd9GcS8FT3_CMJ0E0mj0NYKeH6SSgEnyiplAQlLAGCFN8ZFBA\u0026s\u003d10",554,554],["https://www.pujasthan.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Nazar-Battu-for-Home.jpg",800,800],null,9,"rgb(240,240,80)",null,0,{"2000":[null,"www.pujasthan.com","29KB"],"2001":[null,null,null,9,12,21,21,1],"2003":[null,"qW90rv86Fs81NM","https://www.pujasthan.com/product/nazar-battu-nazar-suraksha-yantra/?srsltid\u003dAfmBOor_flNNk_9OzvsmFSxQAcCgyjtqoZB4sOemmC3FtHHE5ePUPJzp","Wall Hanging Nazar Battu for Home, Office, Nazar Suraksha Kawach for House, Evil Eye Protector",null,0,null,"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q\u003dtbn:ANd9GcSCw3VGtFuqfx1Fzn7qN9XMofs0zwFimZWRke73mMiYos4K74tuiHw2OWLj\u0026s\u003d10",null,0,null,null,"Pujasthan",null,null,null,null,"www.pujasthan.com",null,null,null,null,null,null,0,[null,3],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"https://www.google.com/search/about-this-image?img\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_wEXAOj_ChUIqd_R8_rfjovPARC9yev789WyzyE4vtlcFwAAAA%3D%3D\u0026q\u003dhttps://www.pujasthan.com/product/nazar-battu-nazar-suraksha-yantra/\u0026ctx\u003div\u0026hl\u003den-IN",null,1],"2006":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["2589714322369596591",1,["INR",120],0,"2276446536113155851",null,"About this item Also known as Nazar Battu, Nazar Suraksha Yantra, or Evil Eye Protector Nazar battu, an evil eye protector, is a Hindu spiritual practice that has long